**Introducing RQMTool - fetch RQM test plan**

* RQMTool is a CLI utility to retrieve test cases and test suites from IBM RQM test plans

* Supports fetching selected artifact types (*testcase* or *testsuite*) and exporting them in CSV or JSON format.

* Usage:

  | ``python -m RobotLog2RQM.rqmtool --host <RQM_SERVER_URL> \\``
  |                                ``--project <PROJECT_AREA> \\``
  |                                ``--user <USERNAME> \\``
  |                                ``--password <PASSWORD> \\``
  |                                ``--testplan <TESTPLAN_ID> \\``
  |                                ``[--types <artifact_types>] \\``
  |                                ``[--format <csv|json>] \\``
  |                                ``[--output-dir <DIR>] \\``
  |                                ``[--basename <BASENAME>] \\``
  |                                ``[--dryrun]``
"
